include head
body
  section(class="intro")
    div(class="header") 
      p I never want to hear the words
      h1(style="text-align: center") "NEXT SLIDE, PLEASE!"
      p(style="text-align: right") ever again.
    p
      a(class="present" href="/presenter") Present
      a(class="join" href="/viewer") Join
    p Look, it's the Year of Our Lord 2022. We've got internet-connected refrigerators, the entire run of The Simpsons on streaming, and evil billionaires literally drilling tunnels under LA. Why is it that only one person can have control of a slideshow?
    p Is it the worst or most pressing problem of our era? No. 
      br
      i But it might be the most solvable. 
    p
      video(style='width:100%' title='Introducing "Next Slide, Please!"' controls)
        source(src='https://cdn.zappy.app/d869fda64866d527e1e1f66b2405813d.mp4' type='video/mp4')
    p
      a(class="view-source" href="https://glitch.com/~next-slide-please") View Source

    p 
     i (the next phrase we ban should be "can you see my screen?" — either we'd tell you, or we don't care.)